a 577-formula DAX library along the way — I’ve learned to ask a more precise question than “is this exciting?” The question is: which specific problems does this solve, which does it not touch, and where will it quietly create new ones? Here’s the honest practitioner breakdown.#{1}":[13,28],"##What Actually Shipped (Verified Facts First)":[29,58],"##What Actually Shipped (Verified Facts First)#{1}":[31,32],"##What Actually Shipped (Verified Facts First)#{2}":[33,33],"##What Actually Shipped (Verified Facts First)#{3}":[34,34],"##What Actually Shipped (Verified Facts First)#{4}":[35,35],"##What Actually Shipped (Verified Facts First)#{5}":[36,36],"##What Actually Shipped (Verified Facts First)#{6}":[37,37],"##What Actually Shipped (Verified Facts First)#{7}":[38,39],"##What Actually Shipped (Verified Facts First)#{8}":[40,58],"##The Disease This Actually Cures":[59,74],"##The Disease This Actually Cures#{1}":[61,74],"##The VAL vs EXPR Trap (Where People Will Get Hurt)":[75,92],"##The VAL vs EXPR Trap (Where People Will Get Hurt)#{1}":[77,92],"##What UDFs Don’t Fix":[93,108],"##What UDFs Don’t Fix#{1}":[95,108],"##The 577-Formula Question":[109,126],"##The 577-Formula Question#{1}":[111,126],"##How I’d Actually Start (If This Is Your Model)":[127,142],"##How I’d Actually Start (If This Is Your Model)#{1}":[129,142],"##Where This Actually Lands":[143,163],"##Where This Actually Lands#{1}":[145,163]},"outlinks":[{"title":"Gulab Chand Tejwani","target":"Gulab Chand Tejwani","line":5}],"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[[42,49]],"key":"99.System/InboxArchive/2026-07/DAX Finally Got User - Defined Functions. After 20 Years of Copy - Pasting Measures, Here's What Actually Changes - and What Doesn't.md"},
